                    <size>-1, 70</size>
                    <style>wxALIGN_LEFT</style>
                    <label>Support for recording raw serial data.\nThis data will not be interpreted in anyway, but will be available to extract later.\n\nProvide a reference tag and the hardware connection details below</label>
                </object>
